+- Sampler I2V code path (I2V Step 1 r2, COMPARISON `6abc2815`, selection `m_8b6d9c4119`), synthetic column only: I2V code path: synthetic code-path parity only; no real I2V model admitted.
+  - Inputs: a seeded synthetic i2v checkpoint and seeded I2V inputs. The checkpoint is dim 192, 30 layers, in_dim 36, with 18,694,208 parameters; the untouched original WanModel constructor built it in its own container.
+  - They drove the genuine original nodes and the registered converted nodes.
+  - Plain I2V with clip at cfg 1 and 2, and without clip at cfg 2, is exact: latents, every forward input and output, RNG, and finite outputs.
